<title>SINGAPORE: SOCCER-TIGER CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TIGER CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result on Sunday of the first</p>
<p>game in the 1996 Tiger Cup soccer competition:</p>
<p>Singapore 1 Malaysia 1 (halftime 0-0) </p>
<p>Scorers: </p>
<p>Malaysia - K. Sambagamaran (75th) </p>
<p>Singapore - Fandi Ahmad (88th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 55,000</p>
</text>
